2b:["$","p","Do not apply a rule from one route to another. Check the official course and programme pages before deciding whether a degree, applicant nationality or language document qualifies.",{"children":"Do not apply a rule from one route to another. Check the official course and programme pages before deciding whether a degree, applicant nationality or language document qualifies."}]
